1
00:00:07,759 --> 00:00:09,119
Fellow directors,

2
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,720
(Song Group)
this is the second

3
00:00:12,599 --> 00:00:15,720
acting chairman election.

4
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,320
Ms. Song

5
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,640
and Ms. Yu Song

6
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:20,719
have tied again.

7
00:00:20,719 --> 00:00:22,519
We still can't determine a winner.

8
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:24,559
(Song Group)
If the next vote ties again,

9
00:00:24,719 --> 00:00:28,960
the winner will be decided
by their shareholding percentages.

10
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:34,679
Everyone,

11
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:37,560
the vote is deadlocked.

12
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:40,479
Dragging this out just wastes time.

13
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:43,079
Please give Song Cheng and me
ten minutes.

14
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,640
We need to talk in private.

15
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:45,679
Well...

16
00:00:46,399 --> 00:00:47,560
=Dear Song=
That may not be allowed under the rules.

17
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,359
It's okay.

18
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:52,040
=Episode 23=
(The Final Judgment)

19
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:04,760
What do you want to say?

20
00:01:07,519 --> 00:01:09,760
You're not asking me to just
hand you the position, are you?

21
00:01:21,719 --> 00:01:24,000
This is surveillance footage taken
the day before Song Huan's crash,

22
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,840
while her car was being serviced

23
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,640
at the garage.

24
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:31,120
Most areas were blind spots,

25
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:33,439
but Jing found this angle anyway.

26
00:01:35,439 --> 00:01:37,079
I know this person's silhouette and gait

27
00:01:37,079 --> 00:01:38,599
and his habitual movements

28
00:01:38,599 --> 00:01:39,760
all too well.

29
00:01:40,719 --> 00:01:42,280
He used to service

30
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:44,120
and test your wheelchair.

31
00:01:44,239 --> 00:01:45,519
That's Lin.

32
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:52,120
I looked into him.

33
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:56,959
He's the son of someone who served
your mother's family for years.

34
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:59,359
You funded his repair shop.

35
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:01,840
On paper, he fixes appliances.

36
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,359
But secretly...

37
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:05,439
He's quite skilled.

38
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:10,599
Yu Song.

39
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:14,439
I didn't think you'd find out.

40
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:15,719
How could you be so cruel?

41
00:02:17,439 --> 00:02:18,759
You'd threaten me with this?

42
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,560
Between the two of us,

43
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:28,759
there's no room for mercy.

44
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,319
I'm giving you these ten minutes

45
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,840
to make your choice.

46
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:55,960
(Song Group)

47
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,719
Sorry to keep you waiting.

48
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:02,599
After a thorough discussion
with Ms. Yu Song,

49
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:04,159
I believe

50
00:03:04,639 --> 00:03:06,199
she's better suited

51
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:07,719
to be acting chairman.

52
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:10,039
For the group's stability,

53
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:12,719
I'm voluntarily withdrawing

54
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,520
from this election.

55
00:03:15,719 --> 00:03:17,199
But I remain convinced

56
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,879
that Song Group

57
00:03:18,879 --> 00:03:21,400
must seek change while staying stable.

58
00:03:21,919 --> 00:03:23,159
So I propose

59
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:25,199
a three-month review period.

60
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:25,919
During that time,

61
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:28,960
I'll fully cooperate as a board member

62
00:03:29,719 --> 00:03:31,520
and help lead its transition.

63
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,000
Song Cheng.

64
00:03:50,719 --> 00:03:52,879
Are you here to gloat?

65
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,360
Cheng.

66
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,840
I never wanted to stand against you.

67
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:14,919
♪She said it was wrong from the start♪

68
00:04:14,919 --> 00:04:16,120
If you're willing,

69
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:18,720
we can still be like we used to be.

70
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:21,240
♪But love keeps her from moving on♪

71
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,040
Yu Song.

72
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:24,120
♪She can't let go, caught in between♪

73
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,040
There's no going back.

74
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,360
Some roads...

75
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,639
Once you take the first step,

76
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:31,920
there's no turning back.

77
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:36,640
♪Love and hate share a seam♪

78
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,040
♪Half longing♪

79
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,320
♪Half resentment♪

80
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:46,680
♪Love spreads through the eyes♪

81
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:49,240
♪It shapes infinity♪

82
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:52,000
♪A circle turning endlessly♪

83
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:56,680
♪In whose heart are the lies spreading?♪

84
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:59,040
♪Half is a promise♪

85
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,720
♪Half rotting away♪

86
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:06,360
♪If love always hides something♪

87
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:09,600
♪Then her tears♪

88
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:13,040
♪Fade away♪

89
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,600
(Song Group)

90
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,439
Yu Song...

91
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,439
If I hadn't left it there on purpose,

92
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:29,519
you think it was that easy
to get that garage footage?

93
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:44,920
(Ms. Song Cheng!)

94
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,319
Goodbye, Yu Song.

95
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,720
I hope you get what you want.

96
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,560
As for me...

97
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,879
it's time to do what I must.

98
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,639
How can there be nothing?

99
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:42,839
Was it all erased?

100
00:07:12,839 --> 00:07:13,920
(Song Huaishan.)

101
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:18,519
(So this is the first fortune you made
at the cost of my dad's life.)

102
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,000
(Right here.)

103
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:27,199
Already making big moves, Ms. Yu?

104
00:07:27,319 --> 00:07:28,120
What?

105
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,560
Need financial support from us?

106
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:31,279
Don't worry.

107
00:07:31,279 --> 00:07:32,720
The money here...

108
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,839
Mr. Chen.

109
00:07:37,319 --> 00:07:38,319
This shows that

110
00:07:38,639 --> 00:07:41,199
Xinglong Finance gave Song Group,

111
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,360
then known as Lin Enterprises,

112
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:46,240
an eight-million-yuan interest-free loan

113
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:48,000
paid into its pre-incorporation account

114
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:50,759
three months before registration.

115
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,959
I want to know
where that money came from.

116
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:54,720
Ms. Yu.

117
00:07:55,519 --> 00:07:58,040
That's ancient history.

118
00:07:58,160 --> 00:08:00,959
We've handled countless transactions.

119
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,000
How could I remember every single one?

120
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:06,000
True.

121
00:08:06,519 --> 00:08:07,720
Let's discuss something new.

122
00:08:10,199 --> 00:08:11,000
These are chat records from last month

123
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,920
between your account manager

124
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:15,519
and several real estate agents.

125
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:18,000
They discuss how to bypass
lending restrictions

126
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,399
by taking out business loans

127
00:08:19,399 --> 00:08:22,120
to funnel the money illegally
into real estate.

128
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,720
Ms. Yu, you...

129
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,839
Why go this far?

130
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,319
We've got nothing against each other.

131
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,320
I only want the truth

132
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,039
about those eight million.

133
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:36,120
Explain it to me,

134
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:38,639
and I'll pretend I saw nothing.

135
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,320
That money

136
00:08:41,639 --> 00:08:43,000
wasn't from our company.

137
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,320
It...

138
00:08:46,759 --> 00:08:48,240
came from Song Huaishan.

139
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,799
Back then, he'd just arrived in Nigang.

140
00:08:51,039 --> 00:08:51,919
He came to me

141
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:55,240
and said he'd found a nursery for
rare wild yellow croaker fry.

142
00:08:55,559 --> 00:08:56,720
It was worth a fortune.

143
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,960
But he needed a clean way

144
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,639
to launder the sale proceeds

145
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:03,600
into legitimate start-up capital,

146
00:09:04,039 --> 00:09:05,600
put it into his father-in-law's firm,

147
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,519
and join the business legitimately.

148
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,759
How much did it sell for?

149
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,960
The exact amount...

150
00:09:15,639 --> 00:09:16,600
I don't remember.

151
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:19,200
But once Song Huaishan got the money

152
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,919
and took his share,

153
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,519
he had me send the remaining

154
00:09:22,519 --> 00:09:25,039
eight million as a company loan

155
00:09:25,039 --> 00:09:26,960
to Lin Enterprises' account.

156
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,720
We took a 5% cut.

157
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,960
What was the site owner's name?

158
00:09:38,919 --> 00:09:40,519
I think...

159
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,320
His surname was Yu.

160
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:45,120
Oh, right.

161
00:09:45,559 --> 00:09:47,799
His name was Yu Pingjiang.

162
00:09:47,799 --> 00:09:49,399
I think he was a local fisherman,

163
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:50,320
a simple, honest man.

164
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,000
All right.

165
00:09:53,519 --> 00:09:54,759
This ends here.

166
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:55,519
You may leave.

167
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,279
(Dad.)

168
00:10:06,279 --> 00:10:08,120
(All the evidence is in place.)

169
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:11,159
(It's time to confront Song Huaishan)

170
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:12,759
(and settle our score,)

171
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:15,120
(one debt at a time.)

172
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,399
Excuse me, nurse.

173
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,440
Hello.

174
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:32,120
Where's the patient in this bed?

175
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:35,000
Mr. Song Huaishan
was discharged a week ago.

176
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,960
Discharged a week ago?

177
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,720
Yes.

178
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:40,120
Technically, he'd still need
ongoing rehab.

179
00:10:40,159 --> 00:10:41,639
Ms. Song Cheng came herself

180
00:10:41,639 --> 00:10:44,000
to take him abroad for
treatment and rehab.

181
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,320
The family insisted,

182
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,919
so we had to respect their wish.

183
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,200
Thanks. I understand.

184
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,039
You're welcome.

185
00:10:58,720 --> 00:10:59,519
Song Cheng.

186
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:04,399
Where have you hidden Song Huaishan?

187
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,559
Are you afraid I'll find him,

188
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,399
or do you have other plans?
